flowchart TB
    Q["Question: does the model use language?"] --> C1["① Correct command<br/>'put the bowl on the plate'<br/>→ upper bound"]
    Q --> C2["② Empty command<br/>''<br/>→ scene-memorization baseline"]
    Q --> C3["③ Wrong command<br/>'open the drawer'<br/>→ does language steer?"]
    Q --> C4["④ Paraphrase<br/>'place the bowl onto the plate'<br/>→ meaning or template?"]
    Q --> C5["⑤ Turkish<br/>'kâseyi tabağın üstüne koy'<br/>→ is the language understood?"]
    C1 --> R["Interpretation table:<br/>①≈② → language is not used<br/>③ drops, ② does not → language is 'disruptive' but not 'carrying'<br/>④≈① → meaning; ④≪① → template memorization<br/>⑤≈② → Turkish = noise; ⑤≈① → Turkish is understood"]
    style Q fill:#ffd166,color:#000
    style R fill:#d4f5d4,color:#000
